{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.mp4?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Build Below is a roguelike factory building game for 1-4 players. Think automation game but in a roguelike formula with a deep dive into tower defense elements! The game focuses on strategic decision making, adaptability and risk &amp; reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e08184b6f266e19094fe58d0f4a02277.avif?t=1760603436\" width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character and preferred color. Each character will provide a unique perspective on how to play this game. Together with your friends you can make the perfect team for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/2ba822ac2e42c59f6ea0b47839b0a9c9.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/2ba822ac2e42c59f6ea0b47839b0a9c9.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your factory deep underground on an alien planet with many unique biomes, each holding valuable, rare resources to mine. Your task is to collect, process and ship enough resources each day to meet the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/7adb730077c6b4f1566d1e47adaef068.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/7adb730077c6b4f1566d1e47adaef068.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your machines as they will produce a lot of nasty pollution that attracts dangerous parasites trying to sneak into the shipment. You can defeat these parasites using your characters weapons &amp; tools or by placing turrets that will automatically defend your factory from the parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/33134e73e5c98f90b8ffee76e128653f.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/33134e73e5c98f90b8ffee76e128653f.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many unique biomes all procedurally generated and filled with mysteries and riches. No two playthroughs are the same and you\u2019ll always have something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929340?t=1760603436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/f34b553381b22ec2a0834dd82d4da25dcd3060c7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760603436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/bfa02cde1b4a61f46137352bbe29ffc93da3e203/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760603436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/bfa02cde1b4a61f46137352bbe29ffc93da3e203/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760603436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/13474cd673931b3ba6e45e13a3801852.mp4?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Build Below is a roguelike factory building game for 1-4 players. Think automation game but in a roguelike formula with a deep dive into tower defense elements! The game focuses on strategic decision making, adaptability and risk &amp; reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e08184b6f266e19094fe58d0f4a02277.avif?t=1760603436\" width=1600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character and preferred color. Each character will provide a unique perspective on how to play this game. Together with your friends you can make the perfect team for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/2ba822ac2e42c59f6ea0b47839b0a9c9.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/2ba822ac2e42c59f6ea0b47839b0a9c9.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your factory deep underground on an alien planet with many unique biomes, each holding valuable, rare resources to mine. Your task is to collect, process and ship enough resources each day to meet the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/7adb730077c6b4f1566d1e47adaef068.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/7adb730077c6b4f1566d1e47adaef068.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your machines as they will produce a lot of nasty pollution that attracts dangerous parasites trying to sneak into the shipment. You can defeat these parasites using your characters weapons &amp; tools or by placing turrets that will automatically defend your factory from the parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/33134e73e5c98f90b8ffee76e128653f.poster.avif?t=1760603436\" width=700 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/33134e73e5c98f90b8ffee76e128653f.webm?t=1760603436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many unique biomes all procedurally generated and filled with mysteries and riches. No two playthroughs are the same and you\u2019ll always have something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Everheart"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/62ef1e37d2abe612b43c1305cfdf374f67577701/header.jpg?t=1760603436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"We Build Below","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p resolution</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB), AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><str